  <VME_LeatherApparel_Disliked.stages.wearing_leather_clothing.description>Estoy usando ropa hecha con cuero animal. Se debe evitar matar a un animal para usar su piel.</VME_LeatherApparel_Disliked.stages.wearing_leather_clothing.description>
  
